MetalCraft — native Metal renderer for Minecraft: Java Edition
==============================================================

This repository is a fork of MetalCraft v0.1.0 by Im-Fran:

    https://github.com/Im-Fran/MetalCraft

Upstream is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3
(GPL-3.0). This fork keeps that licence; see LICENSE.

The rendering backend in src/main/java and src/main/native is upstream's
work. Changes made in this fork:

  * capability detection before launch (MetalSupport, MetalCraftPreLaunch)
    so unsupported machines keep the OpenGL renderer instead of crashing;
  * native library loading turned into a recoverable failure;
  * Fabric API dependency removed (it was only used by a development
    screenshot helper);
  * Sodium version pinned to the 1.21.11 build, Fabric Loader 0.19.5;
  * macOS/Apple Silicon version checks, clearer error messages;
  * build/CI packaging for Minecraft 1.21.11 and documentation.

No code from MetalMine is used; MetalMine is closed-source and is not
distributed with, or required by, this project.

Third-party components bundled in the built jar:

  * LWJGL shaderc and spvc modules (BSD-3-Clause), used for
    GLSL -> SPIR-V -> MSL translation;
  * Fabric Loader (Apache-2.0) as a build/runtime dependency.

